            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İlk işlem <code>\"free\"</code> değerini bir sayıya dönüştürür. Bu hatayla hangi işleyici eşleşir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"share = total / quantity\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except KeyError:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ZeroDivisionError:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>except TypeError:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete Three Handlers",
            "id": 152104,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayısal fiyata metin ücreti <code>\"2\"</code> eklemek için üçüncü işleyiciyi tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"record.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = price + \" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Read failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use compatible values&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"231\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Use compatible values\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>TypeError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Handler Order",
            "id": 152105,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod hakkında doğru olan nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")`\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Farklı hata türleri farklı şekilde ele alınabilir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalın <code>except</code>, her hatadan sonra çalışır</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ilk <code>except</code> her zaman çalışabilir</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>ValueError</code> ve <code>KeyError</code><em>Other</em> yazdırır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Farklı hata türleri farklı şekilde ele alınabilir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Preserve Exception Details",
            "id": 152106,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik anahtar istisnasını <code>error</code> değişkeninde yakala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ira&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"'role'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>except</code>, ardından <code>KeyError</code> ve sonra <code>as</code>, <code>error</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
